      "context": [],
      "section": "例题",
      "mode": "choice",
      "questionType": "single_choice",
      "answer": "B",
      "accepted": [
        "B"
      ],
      "invalid": false,
      "ambiguous": false,
      "reviewed": true,
      "reviewStatus": "ok",
      "examNote": "",
      "reason": "busy 是形容词，so busy ... that ... 表示忙到经常忘了休息或吃饭的程度，后面的完整从句说明结果，选 B。very 可修饰 busy，却不能与 that 构成这个结果结构。such 需要适当的名词短语，enough 修饰形容词时通常放在其后。",
      "enrichment": [],
      "sourcePhoto": 3
    },
